version: 2.3.0
date-released: '2026-08-28'
repository-code: https://github.com/sayam/flask-todolist
url: https://github.com/sayam/flask-todolist
abstract: >-
  A Flask to-do application used as the substrate for an experiment in
  machine-checked project governance: every rule the project declares is
  indexed in a registry (gates.yaml) that is verified in both directions,
  each rule must carry evidence that it once failed for a real defect, the
  portable subset is generated into an agent skill and an overlay that can be
  applied to other projects, and the effect on generated code is measured
  against controlled arms. 27 recorded audit rounds, each asking a
  question the previous round could not, are part of the artefact.
keywords:
  - software governance
  - AI-assisted development
  - agent skills
  - supply chain security
  - ASVS
  - ISO/IEC 27001
